{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Moon Guildhouse Simulator is a cozy cooking game where you serve drinks to our loyal guild members! You might even run into some familiar Vtubers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Man our drinks bar and learn the ins and outs of each station. Each station has different equipment and drinks to master.<br><br>Our state of the art coffee station offers espressos, lattes, and americanos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have a wide selection of tea and boba combinations at our boba station!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make something healthy with fruits and vegetables (or not) at our smoothie station!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3eTwitch Integration<br>\ud83d\udc3eBoba and Smoothie Stations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3eDifficulty Customization</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416660?t=1755587196","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416660?t=1755587196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416660/e22a56d1a7312cffb69266c06765260d36db67cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755587196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416660/e22a56d1a7312cffb69266c06765260d36db67cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755587196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Moon Guildhouse Simulator is a cozy cooking game where you serve drinks to our loyal guild members! You might even run into some familiar Vtubers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Man our drinks bar and learn the ins and outs of each station. Each station has diffe